What are the coordinates of the bar? [_]{$bar}{10}

END_PGML

##########
# Solution
##########

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
We have to move [`3`] units to the right, then [`3`] units down. So the coordinates are [`(3,-3)\text{.}`]

