BEGIN_PGML
What are the coordinates of Carl's house? [_]{$carls}{10}

END_PGML

##########
# Solution
##########

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
We don't move at all to get to Carl's house. That is, we move [`0`] units to the left/right, and then [`0`] units up/down. So the coordinates are [`(0,0)\text{.}`]

END_PGML_SOLUTION

